{{Wireless adapter |brand=ZyXEL |model=ZyAIR B-200 |revision=v2.5 |upc=760559109936 |asin=B000083JZ8 |manuf_country= |is_manuf=No |manuf=BroMax |manuf_model=UW250‎ |manuf_rev=v2.5 |availability=EoL |fcc_date=12/26/2001 |fcc_id=O6M-UW250 |if=USB |if_bus_version=1.1 |if_connector_type=Female B |form_factor=corded (modular) adapter |vendor_id=0b3b |device_id=1602 |chip1_brand=Intersil |chip1_model=ISL3871 |chip2_brand=Intersil |chip2_model=ISL3684 |ant_conn= |802dot11_protocols=b |accessible_UART=No |oui=00:A0:C5 |lin_driver= |win_driver= }}
Device also references ID 0b3b:1601 with the same device description :("ZyAIR B-200 Wireless LAN USB Adapter"). P/N '''AM5017-004''' Unknown what the differences were between the units, if any.
Drivers reference the device as 0b3b:1602 for v2.5 and also 0b3b:1603 for v3.0 :(which appears to be used by the [[ZyXEL ZyAIR B-200]]).
The FCC ID is probably O6M-UW250 ([[BroMax UW250‎]]). *{{WiFiCert|W000844|03/03/2003}}
